Persistent CI Runner Lifecycle Controller
Copyright 2026 Lightmeter Ltd

This repository is a source-only, sanitized controller derived from a retired
internal runner lifecycle system developed at Lightmeter. The published source
was substantially adapted to remove deployment-specific identifiers and the
privileged host backend.

The operating history began with GitLab Runner and later included GitHub
Actions. The code in this snapshot was distilled from the later lifecycle
controller and does not include a production adapter for either provider.
